### 특이사항 처리이력
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/issues/1/history

### 특이사항 담당 지정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/issues/1/responsible
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mateId": 2,
  "reason": "현장 확인 담당 변경"
}

### 특이사항 담당 해제
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/issues/1/responsible
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mateId": null,
  "reason": "재배정 대기"
}

### 미확인 → 확인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/issues/1/confirm

### 확인 → 해결
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/issues/1/resolve

### 운영관제
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/operations
